{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">受沙德爾影響，福建、江西等多地都出現暴雨。有內地氣象專家稱，好像沙德爾這樣「復活」的情況很罕見。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">福建泉州周一晚起下暴雨，部分道路水浸。一些區域水深最高超過一米，不少平房被淹浸，有居民要抱著窗框等待救援。截至周二上午，全市共救出過百名被困民眾。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN 1830._001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jUSFzBwUVY1788261235.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN 1830._001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN 1830._002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026kymVMuxqUs1788261262.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN 1830._002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">江西九江則一度發布最高級別的暴雨預警。大雨引發山洪，洪水一度湧上國道，行車一度受阻。吉安市亦有鄉村在暴雨後變成澤國，一度有人被困。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN 1830._003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20267uWRmn3U2l1788261293.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN 1830._003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN 1830._004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026dX71kCbxNh1788261312.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN 1830._004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">湖南郴州近日同樣受沙德爾影響，連日暴雨，有村莊道路變成激流，部分村莊電力及對外交通中斷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">沙德爾上周五在浙江登陸後，其減弱的殘餘旋渦，再度增強為熱帶低氣壓，內地氣象專家形容，沙德爾在華東登陸，又從華南入海「復活」的情況罕見。預計未來兩天會為江南、華南東部及南部等地，帶來強勁雨勢。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T11:40:04.495296+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}